# Normalize line endings (2026-11-23)：仓库与工作区统一 LF。
# core.autocrlf 在 Windows 上默认 true，签出会把 LF 转成 CRLF，导致 Biome
# 行尾检查在本地失败、工作区长期挂着"幽灵改动"；eol=lf 覆盖该行为。
# 显式 binary 标记保证图片 / 字体不做任何行尾转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
